---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About – Boatpass"
  description="Who is behind Boatpass? The story and motivation behind the boating license study app."
  lang="en"
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-text mb-8">About Boatpass</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-lg text-gray-600">
      <p>
        Boatpass was born from a personal frustration: when studying for the boating license,
        there was no app that actually felt good to use. The available alternatives felt outdated,
        cluttered, or overpriced.
      </p>
      <p>
        So we built one ourselves — with the goal of creating the best boating license study app
        on Android. Modern, fast, motivating. Like Duolingo for boating.
      </p>
      <h2>Our promise</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Always up-to-date question catalog</li>
        <li>No subscription — one-time purchase, lifetime access</li>
        <li>No unnecessary extras — only what helps you pass</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Have questions or feedback? Reach us via the <a href="/en/contact/" class="text-primary hover:underline">contact form</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
